# What KSP2 2.3.12 (KSPJvmMain) logs with Headers.kt over headers/: each classifier's modifiers,
# type parameters, supertypes and star-projected type.
w: [ksp] INTERFACE headers.Named modifiers= typeParameters=[] supertypes=kotlin.Any star=headers.Named starText=Named
